        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’ll have to show you later…”</span> He pauses, looking down at the cuffs and his wrists, <span style="color:Pink">blushing a little,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“May- maybe until I get good at doing it, I’ll only practice when you or <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> are around… just in case.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">You laugh as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> puts it away, wondering out loud just how often and for how long <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> has been stuck like that before when playing with these. He doesn’t answer, though his blush and shy smile tell you all you need to know.</span> <br>
